  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two isolated point masses, P of mass m and Q of mass 2m, are separated by a distance 3d. X is a point a distance d from P and 2d from Q.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the net gravitational field strength at X and the net gravitational potential at X?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Net gravitational field strength at X</p></td><td><p>Net gravitational<br/>potential at X</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm}{d^{2}}\"></span></p></td><td><p>0</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm}{d^{2}}\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{Gm}{d}\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm}{2d^{2}}\"></span></p></td><td><p>0</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm}{2d^{2}}\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{2Gm}{d}\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
  },
